  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb08586d69ecf85489aef25def86d39a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 0
  text:
  - Some apartments should never be opened...
  - "This one hasn\u2019t been cleaned since the old couple passed away."
  - The dust kept growing.
  - Then it started moving.
  - Some would call it impossible.
  - "Mom would call it \u201Cyour fault\u201D."
  - Standard cleaning methods were attempted.
  - They failed...
  - <size=150%>You</size> were called
  - Contain the infestation.\nDestroy the nests.
  - The air is <color=#DEDEDE>contaminated</color> and your <color=#DEDEDE>filtration
    system</color> won't last forever.
  - Start cleaning.
  - Leave nothing behind.
  - Suck. It. Up.
  nextScene: MainMenu
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ab2e9f0cba0ee54b9629c6c1e210ed4, type: 3}
